---
# Typed schema for the posts collection. Every .md file next to this file is
# validated against these rules at build time — a missing required field, a
# wrong type, or an unknown extra field fails the build with a file:line.
# Append "?" to a type to make a field optional. Page-shell flags a post sets
# (like transitions) are declared here too. Remove this file to turn
# validation off (it is opt-in).
title: string
date: date
description: string
excerpt: string?
transitions: boolean?
---

The posts collection schema. Posts are plain `.md` files next to this file;
their frontmatter must match the rules above.
